  "student_passage": "Mia: There is a drawing workshop at the art centre tomorrow. Let's go together.\nLeo: Good idea. (1) ____\nMia: At ten in the morning. It finishes at eleven.\nLeo: (2) ____\nMia: Nothing. It's free for pupils.\nLeo: (3) ____\nMia: Bring your own pencil. Paper is provided.\nLeo: I can't find my pencil. (4) ____\nMia: Yes. The centre has pencils for visitors to use during the workshop.\nLeo: (5) ____\nMia: At the centre's front door, five minutes before it starts.\n\n共享句子：\nA. What time does it start?\nB. Can I borrow one here?\nC. How much is a ticket?\nD. Where shall we meet?\nE. What should I bring?\nF. Did you enjoy the film?",
